---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Affiliate Disclosure — Green Nest Co"
  description="How Green Nest Co works: a curated affiliate platform. We may earn a small commission from partner brands at no extra cost to you."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <hr class="eyebrow-rule" />
      <span class="kicker">Transparency</span>
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="lede">Honest about how we work, because that’s the whole point.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="doc">
        <p>
          Green Nest Co (GNc) is a curated lifestyle platform operating on an
          <strong>affiliate marketing model</strong> — not a shop. We don’t hold stock, ship
          products, or manage returns, refunds or customer service.
        </p>
        <h2>What that means for you</h2>
        <p>
          We curate products from brands whose values align with ours, write our own original
          descriptions, and link you to the partner’s own website to complete any purchase. When
          you buy through one of our links, GNc may earn a small commission — at
          <strong>no extra cost to you</strong>.
        </p>
        <blockquote>
          GNc may earn a small commission from partner brands at no extra cost to you.
        </blockquote>
        <h2>Why we chose this model</h2>
        <p>
          It lets us stay a curated, editorial platform rather than a catalogue — recommending
          fewer, better things we genuinely believe in, without the stock risk, logistics or
          pressure to sell that pull a brand away from its values. Our recommendations are guided
          by our sourcing principles and materials standards, never by commission alone.
        </p>
        <h2>Our partners</h2>
        <p>
          We work with aligned UK-first and ethically-minded brands. Where a curated affiliate
          partner’s own materials differ from the standards we hold for GNc-branded curation, we
          note it plainly rather than hide it.
        </p>
        <p class="muted">Last updated: 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
